#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenQASM 3 feature table {#openqasm-3-feature-table}"
msgstr "Jadual ciri OpenQASM 3 {#openqasm-3-feature-table}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Below is a list of the `OpenQASM 3` language features.\n"
msgstr "Berikut adalah senarai ciri bahasa `OpenQASM 3`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more details on these capabilities, see the [OpenQASM 3.X Live Specification](https://openqasm.com/).\n"
msgstr "Untuk maklumat lanjut mengenai keupayaan ini, lihat [Spesifikasi Langsung OpenQASM 3.X](https://openqasm.com/).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key:\n"
msgstr "Kunci:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "❌ Not supported\n"
msgstr "❌ Tidak disokong\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "🟡 Partial support\n"
msgstr "🟡 Sokongan separa\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "✅ Supported\n"
msgstr "✅ Disokong\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The meaning of the complete \"supported\" mark depends on the column:\n"
msgstr "Makna tanda \"disokong\" sepenuhnya bergantung pada lajur:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Qiskit SDK*: The feature can be parsed by [`qiskit.qasm3.loads`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3) (by using the `qiskit-qasm3-import` extension), represented in a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit),\n"
"and exported to OpenQASM 3 by [`qiskit.qasm3.dumps`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3#dumps).\n"
msgstr ""
"*Qiskit SDK*: Ciri ini boleh dihurai oleh [`qiskit.qasm3.loads`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3) (dengan menggunakan sambungan `qiskit-qasm3-import`), direpresentasikan dalam [`QuantumCircuit`,](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)\n"
"dan dieksport ke OpenQASM 3 oleh [`qiskit.qasm3.dumps`.](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3#dumps)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "*IBM Quantum Compute Service*: A circuit containing the corresponding Qiskit feature can be successfully executed on hardware through IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
msgstr "*IBM Quantum Compute Service*: Circuit yang mengandungi ciri Qiskit yang berkaitan boleh dilaksanakan dengan jayanya pada perkakasan melalui IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The meaning of \"partial support\" typically depends on the linked notes.\n"
msgstr "Makna \"sokongan separa\" biasanya bergantung pada nota yang dipautkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
#| "The most common method of submitting circuits to IBM Qiskit Runtime is to create the circuit in the Python-space interface to Qiskit SDK.\n"
#| "Circuits constructed and submitted in this manner do not need to be loaded from OpenQASM 3 files into Qiskit SDK.\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The most common method of submitting circuits to IBM Quantum Compute Service is to create the circuit in the Python-space interface to Qiskit SDK.\n"
"Circuits constructed and submitted in this manner do not need to be loaded from OpenQASM 3 files into Qiskit SDK.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Kaedah paling biasa untuk menghantar litar ke IBM Qiskit Runtime adalah dengan mencipta litar dalam antara muka ruang-Python ke Qiskit SDK.\n"
"Litar yang dibina dan dihantar dengan cara ini tidak perlu dimuatkan dari fail OpenQASM 3 ke dalam Qiskit SDK.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you do not use OpenQASM 3 directly yourself, you can safely use features that are supported for representation in Qiskit SDK, export to OpenQASM 3, and submission to IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
"This includes features that cannot be loaded by Qiskit SDK from OpenQASM 3.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda tidak menggunakan OpenQASM 3 secara langsung, anda boleh menggunakan ciri yang disokong untuk representasi dalam Qiskit SDK, eksport ke OpenQASM 3, dan penghantaran ke IBM Quantum Compute Service dengan selamat.\n"
"Ini termasuk ciri yang tidak boleh dimuatkan oleh Qiskit SDK dari OpenQASM 3.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

